jfet1 nom (27 C, m=1), lin (vgs=0.0, vds=0.2), dc
.model nm njf level=1 vt0=-2 beta=1e-4 lambda=0.02 rd=10 rs=10 cgs=2p cgd=1p pb=0.8 is=1e-14 n=1 fc=0.5 b=0.9 tcv=2e-3 bex=-1.5 xti=3 eg=1.11
vd d 0 dc 0.2
vg g 0 dc 1e-05
j1 d g 0 nm area=2
.temp 27
